  data: {
    LLM: "The player to dealer's left leads any card. Other players must follow suit if possible. The highest card of the led suit wins the trick, and the winner leads to the next trick. If a player cannot follow suit, they must draw cards from the stock one at a time until finding a card of the required suit, which must be played immediately. If the stock is empty and a player cannot follow, they don't play to that trick and must pick up all cards from the incomplete trick at the end, adding them to their hand.",
    Player: "The player to dealer's left leads any card. Other players must follow suit if possible. The highest card of the led suit wins the trick, and the winner leads to the next trick. If a player cannot follow suit, they must draw cards from the stock one at a time until finding a card of the required suit, which must be played immediately. If the stock is empty and a player cannot follow, they don't play to that trick and must pick up all cards from the incomplete trick at the end, adding them to their hand.",
    objective: 'Be the first player to play all your cards. Winner is first to empty their hand.',
    gameplay: "The player to dealer's left leads any card. Other players must follow suit if possible. The highest card of the led suit wins the trick, and the winner leads to the next trick. If a player cannot follow suit, they must draw cards from the stock one at a time until finding a card of the required suit, which must be played immediately. If the stock is empty and a player cannot follow, they don't play to that trick and must pick up all cards from the incomplete trick at the end, adding them to their hand.",
    keyRules: [
      '7 cards dealt to each player',
      'Must follow suit if possible',
      'Highest card of led suit wins trick',
      'Winner of trick leads to next trick',
      'If cannot follow suit, draw from stock until finding playable card',
      'If stock empty and cannot follow, pass and pick up trick cards',
      'First to empty hand wins',
      "Optional joker wins any trick it's played to",
